<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span><span id="A7.F8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FLOPs vs FID</span>: The inverse corrected model achieves better FID despite incurring lower FLOPs. Corresponding LDM models have been added for both datasets for reference.</figcaption>
</figure>
